---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';


const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL ?? '/').replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<BaseLayout title="Latency-Aware Code Optimizer" description="Latency-aware code optimizer: submit code plus runtime context, get profiled hotspots, three rewritten variants per bottleneck, a tradeoff dial and a unified diff. Static analysis only.">
<section class="hero">
  <span class="hero-badge">static analysis · your code never runs</span>
  <h1 class="display-1">Optimize for the traffic<br/><span class="grad-text">you actually have.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Submit code plus runtime context. Get profiled hotspots, load-aware bottleneck predictions, three rewritten variants per bottleneck — speed / memory / balanced — a tradeoff dial, and a unified diff. Static analysis only: your code is never executed.</p>
  <div class="hero-ctas">
<a href={`${base}/submit`} class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Optimize code</a>
<a href={`${base}/analysis`} class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">View an analysis</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-meta">
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 2v3M15 2v3M9 19v3M15 19v3M2 9h3M2 15h3M19 9h3M19 15h3"/></svg>Hotspots + call graph</span>
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3v18M16 3v18M3 8h5M3 16h5M16 12h5M12 5l4 3-4 3"/></svg>3 variants per bottleneck</span>
<span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="11" width="16" height="10" rx="2"/><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4"/></svg>Code is never executed</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="grid-3">
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="14" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 2v3M15 2v3M9 19v3M15 19v3M2 9h3M2 15h3M19 9h3M19 15h3"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Profiled hotspots</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Static analysis finds the hot paths; severity is ranked for you.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="5" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="19" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="12" cy="18" r="3"/><path d="M7.5 8 10 15M16.5 8 14 15M8 6h8"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Call graph</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">See the call structure behind each bottleneck.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Three variants</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Speed, memory and balanced rewrites per bottleneck — scored, not just shown.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3v18M16 3v18M3 8h5M3 16h5M16 12h5M12 5l4 3-4 3"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Tradeoff dial</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">score = 0.5·speed + 0.3·memory + 0.2·readability — turn the dial, watch the pick change.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Unified diff</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Every proposed change, in one reviewable diff.</p>
</article>
<article class="card card-hover p-5 reveal">
  <div class="card-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div>
  <h3 class="text-[1.02rem] font-semibold" style="letter-spacing:-0.01em">Honest labels</h3>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Predicted times are heuristic estimates, labelled as such. No safe transform? It says so.</p>
</article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Showcase</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">The tradeoff dial</h2>
    <p class="lead">How the three variants are scored and picked.</p>
  </div>

<div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3" style="max-width: 50rem; margin: 0 auto">
  <div class="card card-hover p-4 text-center" style="border-color: var(--accent)">
    <p class="eyebrow">speed</p>
    <p class="mono mt-2 text-lg font-semibold" style="color: var(--accent)">10 / 3 / 4</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">list comprehensions, map, set precompute</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card card-hover p-4 text-center" style="border-color: #d29922">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color:#d29922">memory</p>
    <p class="mono mt-2 text-lg font-semibold" style="color: #d29922">3 / 10 / 6</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">generators, streaming, lazy joins</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card card-hover p-4 text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">balanced</p>
    <p class="mono mt-2 text-lg font-semibold">7 / 7 / 8</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">commented, readable transforms</p>
  </div>
</div>

</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Three steps, no fluff</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="grid-3">
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">01</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Submit code + context</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Traffic, data volume, input size — the load the code actually sees.</p>
</div>
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">02</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Read the analysis</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Hotspot severities, the call graph, load-aware predictions.</p>
</div>
<div class="step reveal">
  <div class="step-num">03</div>
  <h3 class="mt-2 text-[1rem] font-semibold">Compare & diff</h3>
  <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-soft)">Speed / memory / balanced variants, the dial, and the unified diff.</p>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reveal">
  <div class="note-band">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
    <p>Static analysis only — submitted code is never executed. Variants are suggestions; review before use.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="cta-band reveal">
    <h2 class="section-title">Where is your code slow?</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin: 0.8rem auto 1.8rem">Paste it in with the traffic it serves, and get three ways forward.</p>
    <a href={`${base}/submit`} class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Optimize code</a>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
